1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,189
Man: Kirin, have you read this book, "Creating beautiful jewelry"?

2
00:00:08,189 --> 00:00:11,440
Woman: Yeah. I read it last year

3
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,150
It was required for a course I took on jewelry design.

4
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:20,000
Man: I want to take a course on that too, but it may not work with my schedule.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,020
Should I buy the book anyway? I'm not sure when I would have time to read it."

6
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:29,250
Woman: Why not? You can always return it if you decide you don't want it."

7
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:32,230
Man: You think I'll get a full refund if I do that?"

8
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:36,160
Woman: Yes, but only if you don't make any notes in it."
